    "lines": [
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "**Date:** 2026-10-17. **Status:** design only. **Branch:** master. **Program:** [cross-repository design](https://github.com/jehalladay/FiberOpticsResearch/tree/main/docs/research/foa/programs/adaptive-computation-and-control-2026-10-17). **Work packages:** AC-01, AC-08, AC-15.",
        "sha256": "6269fecfa50f78df44470984125d7de6d01a5bb8089ce2ebbecbcf10726cdfb6"
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": "2. Separate `acquire` (does host obtain a resource?), `include` (does assembler include a block?), and `place` (where is it positioned?) decisions. Speculation controls acquisition at the host, not assembler execution.",
        "sha256": "3c91dfba0bf04ef2d28a93e3a5016717afa5cb49f350f264345cfca3eaa8b94e"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": "No model execution, tool dispatch, global cache or resource acquisition scheduler. Preserve Python component outputs and existing serialization; let host decide temporal freshness. Use local Forge and installed consumer QA; do not replace extant QA or performance programs. No dependency on DevTools, Mechanical packages or MicroPolicyCLI.",
        "sha256": "748561e84f524814f7c5c4ae4b7c201010ccb9fa96ecf5c685145996262c1170"
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "Acceptance RC-RQ1 immutable verified view projects exact Block; RC-RQ2 unknown not pass; RC-RQ3 changed manifest revokes prior content; RC-RQ4 visibility/audience change prevents cross-scope leakage; RC-RQ5 old keyed/priority/budget behavior unchanged; RC-RQ6 cold-vs-incremental ContextDocument equality; RC-RQ7 no new inference or DevTools dependency. Shared QuerySDK interfaces specified at https://github.com/jehalladay/ReactiveQuerySDK/tree/main/docs/program.",
        "sha256": "08e60baa2f676a4de16b97fd601d86339ef91de67b4a37e78b6454362f0277dc"
      }
    ],
